  {
    "id": "9ItxCUrYoFPFnWpT",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "My Past? Sorry, I'm afraid I can't remember much... When I first open my eyes, the only thing I recalled was a <b>dimly lit room</b>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "id": "Hnz3FcVeTQgtahw7",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "I thought there were only bad humans."
  },
  {
    "id": "Vykd2wEmloJpVWVc",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "But I guess if your Mayor said so, then you're okay."
  }
]

[
  {
    "id": "7C8VRfR5MTOjYMcb",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "After I awake, I found myself in the <b>Dark Place</b>, I ran as far as I could and before I know it I found myself here..."
  }
]

[
  {
    "id": "5N8JqWEOKM60iUl8",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "I drink from the pool every day."
  },
  {
    "id": "JpsvLH61CSJHQDNp",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "It tastes fine to me."
  }
]

[
  {
    "id": "3TKc8ZwTfzdfOd0r",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "Soldiers pass through here a couple times a year."
  },
  {
    "id": "mVUoEz1Rig6TL6Qd",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "We always hide when they do."
  }
]

[
  {
    "id": "FIKGtJSCR39SPxEK",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "This is my spot."
  },
  {
    "id": "lcxlMVM8cT9MBdRW",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "It gets the least sun."
  }
]

[
  {
    "id": "cnnB2wjJlpj2H3BI",
    "type": "showText",
    "speaker": "This",
    "text": "I can see the whole town from up high."
  },
  {
    "id": "O5WawLqORRI1R8qf",
